Interview Questions
1. What is a Service Worker?

A background JavaScript file that intercepts network requests and enables offline capabilities.

2. What are the phases of the Service Worker lifecycle?
Register
Install
Activate
3. What is the purpose of the fetch event?

To intercept network requests and provide custom responses.

4. Why is caching important?

It improves performance and enables offline functionality.

5. What is an Offline-First application?

An application designed to work even without internet connectivity.